WEBVTT

00:00:01.060 --> 00:00:03.350
Be a good friend, won't you, Ellen?

00:00:03.620 --> 00:00:05.300
It's nice to meet you, Ellen!

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:08.490
What's wrong?

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:09.360
This won't work out.

00:00:09.730 --> 00:00:13.110
You're going to die in an accident very soon.

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:15.960
H-How could you say that?

00:00:15.960 --> 00:00:17.770
'Cause I saw it.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:27.020
Told you so.

00:00:29.010 --> 00:00:30.910
<i>I was so alone.</i>

00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:36.250
<i>For better or worse, meeting Vanessa,
 controller of time,</i>

00:00:36.250 --> 00:00:38.830
<i>gave me the power to see the future.</i>

00:00:39.470 --> 00:00:44.240
<i>Each passing day was like 
following the script of a diary.</i>

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:45.930
<i>A script someone else had written.</i>

00:00:46.590 --> 00:00:49.110
<i>How could I do anything
 but go along with it?</i>

00:00:50.030 --> 00:00:51.100
<i>How could I?</i>

00:00:52.610 --> 00:00:55.100
<i>I also learned the date the world will end.</i>

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:59.430
<i>There's a point past which 
I can no longer see the future.</i>

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:05.010
<i>I assume that fated day 
will be the end of everything.</i>

00:01:10.420 --> 00:01:12.780
You're going to catch a cold.

00:01:14.730 --> 00:01:16.230
<i>I knew at first sight...</i>

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:19.680
<i>This girl would play an 
important role in that fate.</i>

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:22.430
<i>Her name is Faria.</i>

00:01:22.860 --> 00:01:25.510
<i>Being friends with her has been easy.</i>

00:01:26.110 --> 00:01:30.440
<i>We grew up together and became 
members of the Seven Knights.</i>

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:33.840
<i>And all the while,
 I've made preparations in secret.</i>

00:01:34.430 --> 00:01:37.200
<i>Preparations for the fateful day to come.</i>

00:01:40.490 --> 00:01:46.710
<i>I don't know what might happen 
if you try to use my power.</i>

00:01:46.710 --> 00:01:48.210
It's almost ironic...

00:01:48.690 --> 00:01:53.210
for this to be the first time 
we can't see our own future.

00:01:53.630 --> 00:01:57.040
<i>But the recoil will surely be great.</i>

00:01:57.560 --> 00:01:59.240
<i>It may even result in...</i>

00:02:00.150 --> 00:02:02.420
<i>Ellen, are you sure about this?</i>

00:02:02.850 --> 00:02:07.160
Yes. I like to go with the flow, after all.

00:03:38.710 --> 00:03:44.180
<b>Conclusion\h\h\h-End Times-</b>

00:03:38.930 --> 00:03:40.130
Unbelievable...

00:03:40.590 --> 00:03:42.990
So you really are invincible!

00:03:43.510 --> 00:03:48.900
I told you... 
I am the one true hero of the new era!

00:03:48.900 --> 00:03:52.500
The fact that you cannot fight 
without the power of heroes of old

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:55.580
makes you mere impostors!

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:01.880
President!

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:05.970
Nemo!

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:08.210
Sorry I'm late.

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:12.520
You're...

00:04:13.500 --> 00:04:17.020
Oh... You've arrived.

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:24.050
Snowfield Slash!

00:04:30.250 --> 00:04:32.290
All right! That's the last of 'em!

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:34.780
Nice one, marathon king.

00:04:34.780 --> 00:04:37.870
Okay, guys! Let's take the ritual site!

00:04:37.870 --> 00:04:38.790
Yes, sir!

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:46.300
So this is what Physis was using to steal 
the power of the silver hourglasses...

00:04:46.600 --> 00:04:49.490
But how'd you know it was here?

00:04:49.490 --> 00:04:52.060
Apparently Ellen found it.

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:55.060
Now we just have to do this.

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:58.270
We set that thing there, and that's it?

00:04:58.270 --> 00:05:00.690
That's what Ellen said.

00:05:00.970 --> 00:05:02.980
And it's not just the ritual site...

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:05.610
There are times it feels 
like she knows everything.

00:05:09.310 --> 00:05:10.330
What's wrong?

00:05:10.990 --> 00:05:15.960
I was contemplating why they didn't tell us 
the details about our objective here.

00:05:16.400 --> 00:05:18.440
Because they're classified, right?

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:20.850
Yeah, I hope that's all it is.

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:27.460
I'm just wondering if there's some 
other reason they didn't tell us.

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:32.000
At last, you have returned to me.

00:05:32.000 --> 00:05:35.350
You are the true Son of Destruction.

00:05:35.350 --> 00:05:36.400
Nemo is?!

00:05:38.070 --> 00:05:39.260
Indeed.

00:05:39.260 --> 00:05:44.990
I produced artificial successors 
to reveal the Son of Destruction.

00:05:44.990 --> 00:05:46.740
What are you saying, Lord Amis?!

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:50.600
You told the three of us that
we were the chosen ones!

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:52.850
You didn't even kill Reda?

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:54.500
What a surprise.

00:05:54.500 --> 00:05:59.210
She's begun to doubt your version of things.

00:05:59.210 --> 00:06:01.250
I've no need to kill her, nor she me.

00:06:01.250 --> 00:06:02.470
She has?

00:06:03.000 --> 00:06:09.510
Are you saying that Castres, Volux, 
and I were nothing but pawns?!

00:06:09.510 --> 00:06:11.010
Indeed.

00:06:11.010 --> 00:06:16.020
Sacrificial lambs to feed 
the true Son of Destruction.

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:21.020
Tools prepared in accordance 
with the prophecy.

00:06:21.020 --> 00:06:22.620
More talk of prophecy...

00:06:25.700 --> 00:06:26.900
Volux...

00:06:27.770 --> 00:06:29.070
Damn you!

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:34.890
Damn you, Amis Germain!

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:44.170
I refuse to accept that I only ever existed...

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:46.920
just so that you could crush me!

00:06:47.670 --> 00:06:49.010
Don't do it! He's—

00:06:50.670 --> 00:06:52.640
Feel the full force of my rage!

00:06:55.740 --> 00:07:00.890
Ah, so you can use your 
hero's power that way as well?

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:03.730
But it won't help you.

00:07:14.870 --> 00:07:15.750
Reda!

00:07:15.750 --> 00:07:17.840
He has absurd regenerative properties.

00:07:17.840 --> 00:07:19.750
Our attacks won't work on him!

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:22.590
You cannot defeat a true hero like me.

00:07:22.590 --> 00:07:24.750
Give up and accept destiny!

00:07:24.750 --> 00:07:27.500
What are you planning to do with Nemo?!

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:33.530
Sacrificing the Son of Destruction will 
incite the coming of the God of Destruction.

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:38.780
It will grant me the power to destroy 
the stagnant status quo of this world!

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:42.040
And you think that's going
 to make people happy?

00:07:42.040 --> 00:07:42.830
I do!

00:07:42.830 --> 00:07:45.650
We need only rebuild a new, idealized state

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:48.530
populated by the strongest and brightest.

00:07:48.530 --> 00:07:50.970
That's no ideal!

00:07:50.970 --> 00:07:51.920
She's right!

00:07:51.920 --> 00:07:55.280
All you want is to conquer the world 
and install yourself at the top!

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:59.540
Surely <i>you</i> can see the 
rightness of my actions.

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:03.790
You, in whom dwells the curse 
destroying the world...

00:08:05.960 --> 00:08:07.430
A curse?

00:08:07.430 --> 00:08:08.150
Yes.

00:08:08.650 --> 00:08:11.800
The curse of the old library is real.

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:18.310
No! Is that...?

00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:21.890
I've managed to stay its progression,

00:08:21.890 --> 00:08:24.080
but I doubt it will last much longer.

00:08:24.080 --> 00:08:25.810
Why didn't you tell us sooner?

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:27.720
I couldn't do that.

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:32.320
The nature of the curse is such
that knowledge of it kills.

00:08:33.900 --> 00:08:36.110
Then... Claire, too...

00:08:36.110 --> 00:08:39.680
Yes. It was far too cruel a fate.

00:08:39.680 --> 00:08:41.870
What happened at the old library, then?

00:08:41.870 --> 00:08:46.690
Should you learn of it,
 you'll be afflicted yourself,

00:08:46.690 --> 00:08:47.630
Gareth.

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:48.680
I don't care.

00:08:48.680 --> 00:08:50.780
I must learn the truth.

00:08:50.780 --> 00:08:53.080
It's the only way to honor Claire's memory.

00:08:54.890 --> 00:08:56.170
Very well.

00:08:56.170 --> 00:08:58.140
Then I shall tell you everything...

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:05.500
about the betrayal of Genius, 
the old librarian.

00:09:19.220 --> 00:09:24.660
Let the prophesied age of glory come!

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:32.240
Nemo!

00:09:32.240 --> 00:09:34.170
Amis Germain! What are you...

00:09:34.170 --> 00:09:35.600
Is it not obvious?

00:09:35.600 --> 00:09:38.290
I'm drawing out the true nature 
of the Son of Destruction,

00:09:38.290 --> 00:09:40.920
and devouring it to fuel myself!

00:09:41.810 --> 00:09:44.430
How can we be so powerless?

00:09:46.910 --> 00:09:49.270
Now, show your true nature!

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:52.350
Take your proper form!

00:09:58.700 --> 00:09:59.620
Nemo!

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:02.170
Nemo!

00:10:05.950 --> 00:10:07.520
Who are you?

00:10:22.250 --> 00:10:25.120
What good will one more reinforcement do?

00:10:25.120 --> 00:10:28.030
It won't change your inevitable loss.

00:10:28.860 --> 00:10:29.980
Gosh...

00:10:29.980 --> 00:10:34.110
All I can see is <i>your</i> inevitable defeat.

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:36.060
Nonsense.

00:10:36.060 --> 00:10:37.360
E-Ellen...

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:38.680
President!

00:10:38.680 --> 00:10:40.780
Please leave this to me.

00:10:40.780 --> 00:10:43.120
So the preparations at the ritual site...

00:10:43.920 --> 00:10:44.870
Correct.

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:46.750
They're all in place.

00:10:46.750 --> 00:10:50.920
Then the ultimate ace you mentioned...

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:52.180
Yes.

00:10:52.180 --> 00:10:55.630
With the power of the ritual site
and Ellen's hero, Vanessa, combined,

00:10:55.840 --> 00:10:59.430
we've got our ace in the hole.

00:10:59.430 --> 00:11:00.630
What?

00:11:01.000 --> 00:11:05.510
<i>I've never seen Ellen wield 
the power of her hero before.</i>

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:08.320
<i>But the president seems 
to know what it is.</i>

00:11:09.750 --> 00:11:13.390
<i>You who, like me, are inscribed 
with the power of time...</i>

00:11:13.900 --> 00:11:19.530
<i>Through this bond we share, 
let the warping of spacetime be undone!</i>

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:24.030
Apologies, President. I'm going 
to stop time here for a bit.

00:11:24.310 --> 00:11:25.830
It'll be over soon, though.

00:11:33.040 --> 00:11:35.540
The power to control time?

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.340
You'll be fighting me.

00:11:45.300 --> 00:11:46.410
What the...

00:11:47.160 --> 00:11:49.180
I guess it's started, huh?

00:11:49.180 --> 00:11:50.810
But what is "it," exactly?

00:11:58.090 --> 00:11:59.320
What is this?

00:11:59.620 --> 00:12:03.950
Using the power amassed in my ritual site...

00:12:03.950 --> 00:12:05.450
I won't allow it!

00:12:08.730 --> 00:12:12.760
Your attacks are meaningless before me.

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:16.530
Heed me, time!

00:12:22.810 --> 00:12:23.580
What...

00:12:24.220 --> 00:12:26.150
Wh-What's happening?!

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:29.670
Impossible!

00:12:29.670 --> 00:12:31.850
The power of the silver hourglasses...

00:12:32.100 --> 00:12:36.980
The only thing capable of affecting
 temporal magic is that selfsame power.

00:12:37.250 --> 00:12:40.610
How did you know about my trump card?

00:12:41.070 --> 00:12:43.360
Because I've already seen it.

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:07.200
Nemo, Ellen...

00:13:07.200 --> 00:13:08.510
What happened?

00:13:09.860 --> 00:13:11.390
This cannot be...

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:14.840
He can't regenerate anymore.

00:13:14.840 --> 00:13:16.770
Then we can fight on even terms!

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.730
You're amazing, Ellen!

00:13:18.730 --> 00:13:21.870
And now that I've served my role...

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:22.650
Ellen?

00:13:22.650 --> 00:13:23.400
Ellen!

00:13:24.330 --> 00:13:25.650
Wake up!

00:13:27.750 --> 00:13:28.910
Thank goodness...

00:13:31.410 --> 00:13:33.600
Please, grant me power!

00:13:33.600 --> 00:13:36.030
Lady Eunomia, grant me power!

00:13:36.030 --> 00:13:37.410
Succession!

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:54.270
I am more than you know!

00:14:00.440 --> 00:14:03.210
Even without the power of 
the silver hourglasses,

00:14:03.210 --> 00:14:05.610
I am still a true hero!

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:08.140
You cannot break me!

00:14:10.900 --> 00:14:12.280
What power!

00:14:13.380 --> 00:14:16.570
We won't waste the opportunity 
Ellen has given us!

00:14:20.040 --> 00:14:21.900
Overconfident fools!

00:14:30.470 --> 00:14:35.600
My ambitions... 
My lofty mission of salvation...

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:40.600
I will not let mere children playing 
with borrowed power stop me!

00:14:41.950 --> 00:14:42.730
Nemo!

00:14:45.730 --> 00:14:48.620
This is it, Son of Destruction!

00:14:48.620 --> 00:14:50.180
Nemo!

00:15:00.350 --> 00:15:01.880
Nemo! Now!

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:03.770
Yeah... I'll end you!

00:15:04.680 --> 00:15:07.720
Legis Breaker!

00:15:18.270 --> 00:15:19.520
Is that...

00:15:19.520 --> 00:15:22.400
<i>I'm not like you...</i>

00:15:28.400 --> 00:15:34.740
Was I not... How could I, the true hero, 
not be the chosen one?!

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:40.600
<i>Of course! It wasn't me, but—</i>

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:50.730
What?!

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:56.680
Nemo!

00:16:07.560 --> 00:16:09.070
What the heck is that?

00:16:34.750 --> 00:16:37.410
We... We did it.

00:16:39.040 --> 00:16:39.560
Nemo!

00:16:39.900 --> 00:16:43.060
Victory... Victory is ours!

00:16:43.060 --> 00:16:47.560
We beat Amis Germain... 
We beat the leader of Physis!

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:51.530
Then the battle with Physis is...

00:16:51.530 --> 00:16:52.320
Yes.

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:54.840
We owe it to you, Nemo.

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:56.030
Faria...

00:16:56.840 --> 00:16:58.050
I see.

00:16:58.050 --> 00:17:01.580
Then my role is over... finally.

00:17:03.600 --> 00:17:05.580
Nemo! Are you okay?

00:17:05.580 --> 00:17:07.960
Yeah. I'm fine.

00:17:07.960 --> 00:17:09.510
O-Okay.

00:17:13.740 --> 00:17:16.250
I've seen those crystals somewhere before.

00:17:20.830 --> 00:17:23.850
The temple is collapsing.

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:24.930
Ellen?

00:17:24.930 --> 00:17:26.600
We must flee with haste!

00:17:28.730 --> 00:17:29.450
Reda!

00:17:30.350 --> 00:17:31.970
Our little alliance is over.

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:34.990
I won't be taken into the 
Seven Knights' custody.

00:17:35.250 --> 00:17:36.240
But...

00:17:36.700 --> 00:17:38.550
You saved me earlier.

00:17:39.070 --> 00:17:42.260
I was just doing what I wanted to.

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:45.340
Now let me offer you a word of warning.

00:17:46.280 --> 00:17:48.960
You were chosen as the Son of Destruction.

00:17:49.270 --> 00:17:51.840
There's no turning back now.

00:17:52.890 --> 00:17:53.950
She's...

00:17:53.950 --> 00:17:55.650
Forget her! Let us escape!

00:18:06.920 --> 00:18:09.480
I knew they'd get it done!

00:18:20.730 --> 00:18:22.090
Great job!

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:27.500
Seven Knights, our mission is complete!

00:18:56.270 --> 00:18:59.320
If not for the power of 
the silver hourglasses,

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.760
that would have been the end of me.

00:19:02.660 --> 00:19:04.950
Yet at this rate...

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:09.600
Son of Destruction, what is this power?

00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:11.600
It's almost like that curse...

00:19:13.710 --> 00:19:15.880
Of course! I see now!

00:19:15.880 --> 00:19:19.390
What a wonderful job 
you've done, Amis Germain.

00:19:20.430 --> 00:19:22.300
That form...

00:19:22.520 --> 00:19:25.250
Why did you bestow upon me a false vision?

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:29.810
Did you not prophesy my victory?!

00:19:29.810 --> 00:19:34.620
Yes. And you led Physis well 
under that belief.

00:19:35.230 --> 00:19:37.300
Just as I hoped you would.

00:19:37.300 --> 00:19:39.070
Then from the start...

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:42.340
You awakened the Son of Destruction,

00:19:42.340 --> 00:19:45.710
and now Ellen's troublesome 
power can no longer be used.

00:19:46.190 --> 00:19:49.450
You've served your role admirably.

00:19:49.450 --> 00:19:51.340
Then you mean I...

00:19:51.340 --> 00:19:53.690
My. You said it yourself, didn't you?

00:19:53.690 --> 00:19:56.090
Heroes are tools.

00:19:56.090 --> 00:19:57.590
Isn't that nice?

00:19:57.900 --> 00:20:00.640
You proved you really were one.

00:20:03.850 --> 00:20:06.260
Farewell, Amis Germain.

00:20:06.260 --> 00:20:11.600
Now the plans of my dear Physis 
can enter their final stage.

00:20:11.810 --> 00:20:16.110
Not superficially in the way you believed...

00:20:17.640 --> 00:20:23.430
But in earnest, so that we may destroy
 the world without a trace.

00:22:08.430 --> 00:22:13.170
Not only did we thwart Physis's plan, 
we beat their big boss, too!

00:22:13.170 --> 00:22:17.440
It certainly is an accomplishment, 
but we can't rest easy just yet.

00:22:17.440 --> 00:22:18.720
Aw, c'mon.

00:22:18.720 --> 00:22:20.810
Let us relax for one day.

00:22:22.040 --> 00:22:23.470
Oh, you all!

00:22:23.820 --> 00:22:27.280
Ellen, I'd like a proper 
explanation from you as well.

00:22:27.280 --> 00:22:29.570
Certainly. Later.

00:22:30.210 --> 00:22:32.570
<i>My hero's power is expended...</i>

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:36.380
<i>But this should be the last of the buildup.</i>

00:22:37.080 --> 00:22:38.160
<i>All that remains now...</i>

00:22:41.500 --> 00:22:42.470
What's going on?

00:22:46.610 --> 00:22:47.340
Nemo.

00:22:48.230 --> 00:22:49.820
I'm taking you in.

00:22:49.820 --> 00:22:52.100
H-Hey! The heck are you doing, Gareth?

00:22:52.100 --> 00:22:55.030
That thing isn't human.

00:22:55.030 --> 00:22:57.850
It's an artificial successor 
created by Physis.

00:22:58.100 --> 00:22:59.800
A synthetic life form.

00:23:02.090 --> 00:23:03.940
Y-You gotta be kidding...

00:23:03.940 --> 00:23:06.860
And your rampage, Gildan...

00:23:06.860 --> 00:23:11.070
Claire's death, and everything
 else that's happened...

00:23:12.620 --> 00:23:15.010
You caused it all, Nemo!

00:23:18.540 --> 00:23:21.100
<i>Ah, thought so.</i>

00:23:21.840 --> 00:23:23.580
<i>Here we go.</i>

00:23:25.550 --> 00:23:28.260
You're the cursed successor of Physis.

00:23:28.260 --> 00:23:30.550
You were the Son of Destruction?

